[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_03_0009","text":"声乐教练"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_03_0010","text":"今天的训练内容是\n『传达文字中承载的情感』──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_03_0020","text":"──各位都选好了剪报带来了吧？\n彼此之间没有告知内容对吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_03_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_03_0030","text":"那么，带着传达文字的意識\n依次来读一下吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_03_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_03_0032","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_03_0033","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_03_0034","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_03_0040","text":"『湛蓝的天空中，白云朵朵……\n　我是一只梦想着天空的小鸟……』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_03_0050","text":"『啊，有人在那里吗？\n　蜡烛微弱的灯火，照不见你的身影』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_03_0060","text":"『来吧，大家一起，把鱼传给巡！\n　一个，两个……！』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_03_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_03_0070","text":"……喂，难道说\n我们……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_03_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_03_0080","text":"果然，是同一本杂志的剪报！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_03_0090","text":"嗯……我觉得用词温柔的绘本\n比较容易传达信息……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_03_0100","text":"我也是……\n……不过总觉得，变成像在念绘本故事一样了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_03_0101","text":"Motion"}]
